    {
      "case_id": "u6-req-0096",
      "profile": "Local macOS arm64 public signed native QUIC (EdDSA/ES256), ordinary public human appearances, current bearer HTTP recovery.",
      "assertions": [
        "Acceptance and negotiation alone emit no joined fact. Actual sendonly RTP under current verified source authority commits original PID/Identity/kind/Session role/display-name/joined_at/via-Connection metadata.",
        "A second actual Connection for the same Participant does not duplicate joined. A receiver with no media Connection or subscription receives start before joined through current per-writer authorization.",
        "Original joined metadata survives later role changes and loss; rejoin after departure on the same live SID creates a distinct new fact. Shared SDK vectors reject foreign scope/Participant, invalid kind and malformed metadata."
      ]
    },
    {
      "case_id": "u6-req-0097",
      "profile": "Same local native profile; actual last-Connection retirement, explicit Session leave and same-SID rejoin. Kicked provenance/removed recipient epochs additionally have controlled Store coverage.",
      "assertions": [
        "Ending only the first of two actual Connections produces no left; ending the last produces original participant_id/left_at/all-connections-ended without Connection, operation or reply scope.",
        "A later actual ready Connection rejoins the same SID without a new Session start. Explicit authorized Session leave emits explicit-leave; exact logical receipt replay emits no duplicate departure.",
        "The authoritative journal recovers the four original joined/left facts and typed hints in order. Captured epochs and owner-only mutation correlation commit before immutability; current epoch/permission and newest-appearance admission govern delivery."
      ]
    }
  ],
  "implementation": [
    "Immutable participant facts and connected appearance state distinguish accepted participation from verified public readiness. Additional/pending/replacement Connections preserve the logical appearance until settled; no packet-silence inference.",
    "Readiness, first Active transition and joined journal state share one transaction. Explicit Session control, removal, ledger settlement and observed native retirement reconcile left facts inside the source transaction. Removed recipients retain explicit original PID/epoch headers.",
    "The bounded source-ordered start/join/left metadata worker uses a separate read-only committed snapshot (16 references,50ms SQLite busy bound), never the foreground media/control connection mutex. Actual per-recipient IO still reacquires the current source/credential/Device/key/epoch/recipient ceiling proof through the authoritative Store.",
    "Native guarded transport assigns final unique signed wire IDs. Internal metadata references bind each original fact before signing; HTTP catch-up also constructs fresh envelope IDs. Original fact IDs, times and roles remain immutable."
  ],
